      "topLeftX": 66,
      "topLeftY": 197,
      "bottomRightX": 651,
      "bottomRightY": 282,
      "content": "In case a serial device supports multiple baud rates, the Heartbeat mechanism must be supported in order to ensure a fall back after a faulty baud rate configuration. In case the device loses the Heartbeat, the link falls back to the default 9600 baud so that the host can re-establish communication after a switch to a baud rate that is too high. In case the device only supports the default baud rate, the Heartbeat mechanism is optional.",
